  "worked_solution": "The simple harmonic motion (SHM) equation is\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}+{\\omega }^{2}y=0.\n$$\n\nWe can see that the only equation that represents SHM is\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2033}+2y=0.\n$$\n\nIn the above case:\n\n$$\n{\\omega }^{2}=2\\,\u27f9\\,\\omega =\\sqrt{2}\n$$",
